{"name_en": "Dynamius (conspirator against Gallus)", "zh": "迪納米烏", "sei": "迪納", "mei": "米烏", "zh_full": "迪納米烏斯", "sex": "m", "years": [354, 354], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "其他", "place": "羅馬", "lat": 41.9, "lon": 12.5, "offices": [], "kin": [], "friends": ["Picentius", "Gaius Ceionius Rufius Volusianus Lampadius"], "foes": ["Constantius Gallus"], "bio": "出身微賤，欲藉讒言致位。與皮森提烏斯結宮中宦官，屢進讒於君士坦提烏斯二世，誣凱撒加盧斯不足於凱撒之位，圖謀帝位，禁衛軍長官蘭帕迪烏斯亦與其謀。君士坦提烏斯信之，召加盧斯至，褫其凱撒之號而殺之。", "stats": [15, 20, 58, 35, 20], "lean": "無", "conf": "B", "src": "Zosimus 2.55"}
{"name_en": "Picentius", "zh": "皮森提", "sei": "皮", "mei": "森提", "zh_full": "皮森提烏斯", "sex": "m", "years": [354, 354], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "其他", "place": "羅馬", "lat": 41.9, "lon": 12.5, "offices": [], "kin": [], "friends": ["Dynamius (conspirator against Gallus)", "Gaius Ceionius Rufius Volusianus Lampadius"], "foes": ["Constantius Gallus"], "bio": "出身微賤，欲藉讒害他人以求顯達。與迪納米烏斯及宮中宦官共誣凱撒加盧斯欲自立為帝，禁衛軍長官蘭帕迪烏斯附和其事，終使君士坦提烏斯二世廢殺加盧斯。", "stats": [15, 20, 55, 35, 20], "lean": "無", "conf": "B", "src": "Zosimus 2.55"}
